      "message": "While porting PixelOS to the Xiaomi 15, we captured a storage snapshot from our 1 TB test device. We replayed the same snapshot before and after the fix and compared the results below. All values are in decimal GB.\n\n| Storage metric | Before the fix | After the fix |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| Total internal storage | 1,000.00 GB | 1,055.87 GB |\n| Used storage | −37.29 GB | 18.58 GB |\n| Storage attributed to the Android system | −43.07 GB | 12.80 GB |\n\nBefore the fix, the reported total was smaller than the available space, so Settings calculated a negative value for used storage. With the fix, the reported total matches the block device size, and the same snapshot yields 18.58 GB used.\n\nSee the comparison filmed on device:\nhttps://static.melon.blue/Screenshot_20261126_011030.png",
